        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Esekia atũmana kwa Isilaeli na Yuta onthe, o na amaandĩkĩa Evalaimu na Manase mavalũa, moke nyũmbanĩ ya Yeova Yelusaleme, malilikane vasaka kwondũ wa Yeova, Ngai wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ mũsumbĩ nĩwasũanĩĩte, na anene make me mbee ũsumbĩnĩ, na ũmbano w’onthe ku Yelusaleme, malilikane vasaka mwei wa kelĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
