        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ na ũmbano w’onthe moona ũndũ ũsu nĩ mũseo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu matw’a ũtw’ĩo matavan’ye katĩ wa Isilaeli onthe, kuma Mbeeli‐sieva o na kũvika Ndani, moke malilikane vasaka kwondũ wa Yeova, Ngai wa Isilaeli, ku Yelusaleme: nĩkwĩthĩwa matyaaũlilikana me aingĩ o tondũ kũandĩkĩtwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu atwai ma mavalũa nĩmaendie katĩ wa Isilaeli na Yuta kw’onthe na mavalũa maumĩte kwa mũsumbĩ na anene make me mbee ũsumbĩnĩ, o kwĩanana na mwĩao wa mũsumbĩ, makyasya, Inyw’ĩ ana ma Isilaeli, mwĩthyũũĩei Yeova Ngai wa Avalaamu, na Isaka, na Isilaeli ĩngĩ, nĩ kana asyokee ũtialo wa inyw’ĩ ala mũvonokete kuma kw’okonĩ kwa asumbĩ ma Asuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
